  "body": "## Curated hierarchical Philippine barangay boundaries — `v2026.4.13.0` (snapshot `2023-10-24`)\n\nPhilippine barangay, municipality, and city (split by legal class), province, region, and\nspecial-geographic-area boundaries as **per-class GeoJSON** — the curated end product — with\nevery polygon annotated with its canonical **PSGC code**. Derived from **PSA** Philippine\nStandard Geographic Code snapshots and **NAMRIA** administrative-boundary shapefiles\n(v2023-11-06). The `enriched` (`adm0`–`adm4`) and `raw` NAMRIA-converted files are\nintermediate pipeline stages kept in-repo for traceability (not attached to this release).\n\n### Downloads\n\n| Asset | Contents |\n|-------|----------|\n| `barangay-boundaries-2023-10-24-hierarchical.zip` | per-class GeoJSON bundle (barangays, provinces, regions, HUC/ICC/component cities, …) |\n| `barangays.geojson`, `regions.geojson`, `provinces.geojson`, … | individual per-class extracts |\n| `classification_report.json`, `summary.md` | per-class counts + classification summary |\n| `manifest.json` | MD5 / SHA-256 / size / feature count per file |\n\n### Data coverage (2023-10-24)\n\n| Level | Matched | Coverage |\n|-------|--------:|---------:|\n| Region (ADM1) | 17 | 100.000% |\n| Province (ADM2) | 88 | 100.000% |\n| Municipality/City (ADM3) | 1,624 | 99.877% |\n| Barangay (ADM4) | 41,803 | 99.947% |\n| **Total** | **43,533** | **99.945%** |\n\n### Attribution\n\n- PSGC data © **Philippine Statistics Authority (PSA)**.\n- Boundaries © **NAMRIA**, shapefile version 2023-11-06.\n- Code © Manuel Balmeo, MIT License.\n\n\n## What's Changed\n* ci(deps): bump softprops/action-gh-release from 2 to 3 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/bendlikeabamboo/barangay-boundaries-repository/pull/5\n* ci(deps): bump actions/checkout from 4 to 6 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/bendlikeabamboo/barangay-boundaries-repository/pull/4\n* ci(deps): bump astral-sh/setup-uv from 6 to 7 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/bendlikeabamboo/barangay-boundaries-repository/pull/3\n* ci(deps): bump actions/upload-pages-artifact from 3 to 5 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/bendlikeabamboo/barangay-boundaries-repository/pull/2\n* ci(deps): bump actions/setup-python from 5 to 6 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/bendlikeabamboo/barangay-boundaries-repository/pull/1\n\n## New Contributors\n* @dependabot[bot] made their first contribution in https://github.com/bendlikeabamboo/barangay-boundaries-repository/pull/5\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/bendlikeabamboo/barangay-boundaries-repository/commits/v2026.4.13.0",
